# Changelog fragments

Drop one `.md` file here per user-visible change. Each file becomes a single
bullet point in the changelog. File names don't matter.

Write in plain English from the user's perspective. Good:

    Added option to skip single-note trainer when you answer incorrectly.

Bad:

    Refactored `should_load_single_note_trainer` to accept a correctness flag.

`make html`, `make serve`, and `make release` render pending entries under
`Web-only Preview` without changing or deleting the fragments. The next stable
Android release moves them permanently into `NEWS.md` under its version.
